  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Barevný průměr</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> April 2017 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>V levé části obrazu je umístěno 1156 fotografií v rastru 34x34 px. Každý barevný pixel reprezentuje průměrnou barvu jednotlivé fotografie z daného státu.\nNa pravé části obrazu je průměrná barva všech pixelů z levé části, tedy průměrná barva všech fotografií z daného státu.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-1.png\" alt=\"Česká republika\"> </a> <figcaption>Česká republika</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"Čína\"> </a> <figcaption>Čína</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"Ekvádor\"> </a> <figcaption>Ekvádor</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"Kenya\"> </a> <figcaption>Kenya</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"Mexiko\"> </a> <figcaption>Mexiko</figcaption> </figure> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Color Average</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> April 2017 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>The left side of the image contains 1,156 photographs arranged in a 34x34-pixel grid. Each colored pixel represents the average color of a single photograph from a given country.\nOn the right side of the image is the average color of all pixels from the left side—that is, the average color of all photographs from a given country.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-1.png\" alt=\"Česká republika\"> </a> <figcaption>Czech Republic</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"Čína\"> </a> <figcaption>China</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"Ekvádor\"> </a> <figcaption>Ecuador</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"Kenya\"> </a> <figcaption>Kenya</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/barevny-prumer-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"Mexiko\"> </a> <figcaption>Mexico</figcaption> </figure> </div> ",
